(1, '2026-27', 350.00, 500.00, 1, 1, '1. The referral code is valid only for the academic year for which it was issued (2026-27).\r\n2. Referral earnings are credited only after the referred student\'s admission is approved and onboarding is completed.\r\n3. If the referred student opts for an instalment plan, 50% of the referral earnings are credited on onboarding and the remaining 50% once all dues are cleared.\r\n4. A referred student can use a referral code only once.\r\n5. PEPP Learning reserves the right to modify or discontinue the referral program at any time.\r\n6. Referral earnings will be paid to the bank/UPI details provided by the referee. PEPP Learning is not responsible for incorrect payout details.\r\n7. PEPP may change the referee and referral earning amounts based the course fee adjustments at any time\r\n8. Any misuse or fraudulent activity will result in disqualification from the program.', 'ALUM', 6290, '2026-06-15', '2027-03-10', 'active', 'superadmin', '2026-06-15 23:40:07', NULL);
